#
# cybomantorus.obj - Inward-facing torus shell, quad faces
#
# Geometry:   a torus centred on the origin, its axis along x, ring radius
#             2.25 out to the tube's centerline and tube radius 1, so it
#             spans 6.5 x 6.5 across y and z, 2 along x.
# Components: 576 vertices, 625 UV coordinates, 576 vertex normals, and 576
#             quad faces, 24 rings of 24 each. The normals are the analytic
#             inward normals of the surface, unit length, and the faces are
#             wound to read correctly from inside the tube. The UVs run 0 to
#             1 once around each way, u around the ring and v around the
#             tube, with the seam row and column duplicated so the wrap does
#             not fold the map back over itself.
# Used by:    cybomantorus.
#
